{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34185","headline":"美人 · 陆龟蒙","name":"美人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"美人抱瑶瑟，哀怨弹别鹤。\n雌雄南北飞，一旦异栖托。\n谅非金石性，安得宛如昨。\n生爲竝蒂花，亦有先後落。\n秋林对斜日，光景自相薄。\n犹欲悟君心，朝朝佩兰若。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34185.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34185","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}